  "description": "Cha Yun-Ho can’t shake the feeling that a suspicious man in sunglasses is following him, shameless eyes glued to his bodacious backside. Just as Yun-Ho tries to get away, the man suddenly makes an outrageous offer. He wants Yun-Ho to become the model for his brand. To Yun-Ho’s shock, the stranger turns out to be Kwon Wu-Hyeok, his first love from fourteen years ago. Before he knows it, Yun-Ho finds himself working at what might be the best job imaginable, spending all day with Wu-Hyeok. There’s just one problem: Wu-Hyeok’s brand’s clothing is a little short, tight, and triangular for Yun-Ho’s liking… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
